---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactAction from '../components/ContactAction.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---
<Layout>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero container">
<div class="hero-copy"><div class="status"><span></span>{site.status}</div><h1>Build a business<br />around a problem<br /><em>worth solving.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">Practical mentorship. Customer validation. Technical execution. A founder-led incubator for the next generation of Canadian technology businesses.</p><div class="actions"><ContactAction label="Express Interest" subject="Founder interest — FoundNexa" /><a class="text-link" href="#program">Explore the program <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>{!site.email && <p class="contact-note">Our contact channel is being finalized. Please check back.</p>}</div>
<div class="hero-art" role="img" aria-label="Geometric steps connecting a customer problem to a growing venture"><div class="art-grid"></div><span class="art-label top-label">A STRONGER FOUNDATION</span><svg class="building" viewBox="0 0 500 480" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M65 365 239 465 437 350 265 251Z" fill="#d8e1d9"/><path d="M65 365v-91l90 51v92Z" fill="#91aaa0"/><path d="m65 274 109-63 90 52-109 62Z" fill="#d5dfd4"/><path d="m155 325 109-62v91l-109 63Z" fill="#547b70"/><path d="M174 211V121l91 52v90Z" fill="#7f9e90"/><path d="m174 121 108-63 91 52-108 63Z" fill="#e1e7d9"/><path d="m265 173 108-63v180l-108 64Z" fill="#234f47"/><path d="M282 58V26l91 52v32Z" fill="#a6b9a7"/><path d="m282 26 54-31 91 52-54 31Z" fill="#e5eadb"/><path d="m373 78 54-31v212l-54 31Z" fill="#426c5b"/><path d="m40 393 197 113 226-130" stroke="#6c8d7c" stroke-dasharray="4 5"/><circle cx="40" cy="393" r="5" fill="#204e43"/><circle cx="463" cy="376" r="5" fill="#204e43"/></svg><div class="art-caption"><span>01 / START WITH THE PROBLEM</span><span>BUILD WITH PURPOSE ↗</span></div></div>
</section>
<div class="intro-strip"><div class="container"><span>Rooted in Ontario. Built for founders.</span><span>B2B SOFTWARE <i>·</i> SAAS <i>·</i> AI-ENABLED VENTURES <i>·</i> TECHNOLOGY SERVICES</span></div></div>
<section id="about" class="section container about"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 — The foundation</span><h2>Good businesses start<br />with better questions.</h2></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="lead">What problem matters enough to solve? Who needs it solved? And what would make the business work?</p><p>FoundNexa is developing a founder-led incubator based in the Greater Toronto Area, serving early-stage technology founders across Ontario. Our mission is to help Canadian founders turn meaningful customer problems into validated, sustainable businesses.</p><p>We bring customer understanding, commercial judgment, and product execution into the same conversation—with focused support and clear venture milestones.</p><a href="#program" class="text-link">A practical path forward <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></section>
<section class="fit-section"><div class="container fit-layout"><div><span class="eyebrow">Who we support</span><h2>Early in the journey.<br />Serious about the work.</h2><p>You don’t need all the answers. You do need a meaningful problem and the commitment to investigate it.</p></div><div class="fit-list"><div><span>01</span><p>Canadian technology founders building B2B software, SaaS, AI-enabled ventures, or technology services.</p></div><div><span>02</span><p>Teams with relevant domain knowledge and a clear customer problem to explore.</p></div><div><span>03</span><p>Founders ready to own customer research, sales, and product decisions.</p></div><p class="small">Selection will consider commitment, customer evidence, technical feasibility, and program fit. Early validation is valuable; existing revenue is not required.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="program" class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">02 — The planned program</span><h2>Twelve weeks.<br />A clearer way forward.</h2></div><p>A structured journey from assumptions to evidence, with hands-on mentorship and milestones that keep the work focused.</p></div><ol class="timeline">{site.stages.map(([number, weeks, title, description]) => <li><span class="timeline-number">{number}</span><span class="weeks">{weeks}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p></div><span class="stage-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></li>)}</ol><div class="program-note"><h3>Clear expectations from the start.</h3><div><p>The intended outputs are stronger customer evidence, a focused product direction, and a practical next-stage plan. Revenue, investment, introductions, and product success are not guaranteed.</p><p>Participation may involve negotiated minority equity. Scope and terms will be documented in a separate agreement and disclosed before joining.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="services" class="services-section"><div class="container section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">03 — Product & software services</span><h2>Make the next step<br />something tangible.</h2></div><p>For founders and businesses that need help turning a product direction into a working solution.</p></div><div class="service-list">{site.services.map(([title, description], index) => <article><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">{['⌁', '◇', '⊞', '↗'][index]}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p></article>)}</div><div class="service-bottom"><p><strong>Optional. Separately scoped. Your choice.</strong><br />Services are separately priced and contracted, and available to businesses outside the incubator. Participants can decline without losing program support and are free to use other providers.</p><ContactAction label="Discuss Your Project" subject="Development project — FoundNexa" secondary /></div>{!site.email && <p class="contact-note">Project enquiries will be available once our contact channel is confirmed.</p>}</div></section>
<section id="partners" class="section container partners"><div><span class="eyebrow">04 — Build the ecosystem</span><h2>Better together.<br /><em>Built on contribution.</em></h2></div><div><p class="lead">Experience is valuable. Sharing it can move a founder forward.</p><p>We welcome conversations with experienced operators, technical specialists, professional advisors, educational institutions, sponsors, and workspace providers.</p><p>Possible contributions include mentoring, practical workshops, referrals, and founder resources. We’re exploring these relationships as we prepare for launch.</p><ContactAction label="Discuss a Partnership" subject="Partnership conversation — FoundNexa" />{!site.email && <p class="contact-note">Partnership contact details are coming soon.</p>}</div></section>
<section class="measurement"><div class="container section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">05 — What progress means</span><h2>Evidence over noise.</h2></div><p>These are the measurement priorities we intend to use—not a record of past results.</p></div><div class="priority-list">{site.priorities.map(([title, description], index) => <div><span>0{index + 1}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section id="faq" class="section container faq"><div><span class="eyebrow">06 — A few good questions</span><h2>Before you<br />take the next step.</h2><p>Clarity matters from the beginning.</p></div><div class="faq-list">{site.faqs.map(([question, answer]) => <details><summary>{question}<span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}</div></section>
<section id="contact" class="contact-section"><div class="container section"><span class="eyebrow">07 — Start a conversation</span><div class="contact-heading"><h2>What are you<br /><em>working on?</em></h2><p>Whether you’re exploring a venture, planning a product, or looking to contribute, there’s a place to start.<br /><span>{site.location}</span></p></div><div class="contact-paths"><div><h3>I’m building a venture</h3><p>Explore future incubation participation.</p><ContactAction label="Express Interest" subject="Founder interest — FoundNexa" /></div><div><h3>I have a product in mind</h3><p>Discuss a software or development project.</p><ContactAction label="Discuss Your Project" subject="Development project — FoundNexa" /></div><div><h3>I’d like to contribute</h3><p>Explore mentorship or a partnership.</p><ContactAction label="Discuss a Partnership" subject="Partnership conversation — FoundNexa" /></div></div>{!site.email ? <p class="contact-unavailable"><span aria-hidden="true">◌</span> We’re preparing for launch. Contact details are being finalized; email actions are currently unavailable. Please check back.</p> : <p class="contact-unavailable">You can also email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>}</div></section>
</main>
</Layout>
